This licence covers the files written for this project. Third-party files keep
their own licences:
- camd/third_party/qmmf-sdk: Qualcomm's qmmf-sdk headers, BSD-3-Clause,
  Copyright (c) The Linux Foundation; see camd/third_party/qmmf-sdk/NOTICE.
- camd/third_party/qmmf-webserver: Qualcomm's video analytics interface header,
  BSD-3-Clause, Copyright (c) The Linux Foundation; see
  camd/third_party/qmmf-webserver/NOTICE.
- device/camera/vaidk-camd and device/detect/vaidk-detect are built from camd/,
  including those headers, so their BSD-3-Clause notices apply to them too. On
  the camera they use Qualcomm's libraries, which are not part of this
  repository.
- images/vision-ai-devkit.png: a picture of the Vision AI DevKit by Microsoft,
  from https://github.com/Azure/Vision-AI-DevKit-Pages
  (docs/assets/images/camera-render-transparent.png), licensed under
  CC BY 4.0, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/. Cropped and resized.
